# Inline structure. See defects.case for the dump grammar.

=== italic_star_and_underscore
*one* and _two_
--- expect
p i"one" " and " i"two"

=== bold_star_and_underscore
**one** and __two__
--- expect
p b"one" " and " b"two"

=== intraword_underscore_stays
x_y_z and snake_case_name
--- expect
p "x_y_z and snake_case_name"

=== intraword_star_emphasis
un*frigging*believable
--- expect
p "un" i"frigging" "believable"

=== math_star_with_spaces
a * b * c
--- expect
p "a * b * c"

=== dunder_file_in_code
Edit `__init__.py` now
--- expect
p "Edit " c"__init__.py" " now"

=== tilde_range_single
It takes 20~25 minutes.
--- expect
p "It takes 20~25 minutes."

=== tilde_range_two_occurrences
Takes 20~25 min or 30~35 min.
--- expect
p "Takes 20~25 min or 30~35 min."

=== dollar_amounts
It costs $5 and $10.
--- expect
p "It costs $5 and $10."

=== less_than_comparison
if a < b and c <= d then
--- expect
p "if a < b and c <= d then"

=== escaped_backtick_and_underscore
\`not code\` and snake\_case
--- expect
p "`not code` and snake_case"

=== code_span_keeps_markup
Use `**not bold**` and `a_b_c`.
--- expect
p "Use " c"**not bold**" " and " c"a_b_c" "."

=== code_span_trims_one_space
`` `x` ``
--- expect
p c"`x`"

=== bold_with_link
**see [the docs](https://d.dev/x)**
--- expect
p b"see " a(https://d.dev/x)b"the docs"

=== link_with_title
[docs](https://d.dev/x "Title")
--- expect
p a(https://d.dev/x)"docs"

=== link_with_emphasis_label
[**bold** label](https://d.dev)
--- expect
p a(https://d.dev)b"bold" a(https://d.dev)" label"

=== link_url_with_parens
[w](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foo_(bar))
--- expect
p a(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foo_(bar))"w"

=== link_relative_path
[the module](src/lib/a.dart)
--- expect
p a(src/lib/a.dart)"the module"

=== bare_url_in_parens
(see https://example.com/x)
--- expect
p "(see " a(https://example.com/x)"https://example.com/x" ")"

=== bare_url_with_query_and_comma
Go to https://example.com/a?b=1&c=2, then stop.
--- expect
p "Go to " a(https://example.com/a?b=1&c=2)"https://example.com/a?b=1&c=2" ", then stop."

=== bare_www_autolink
Visit www.example.com for more.
--- expect
p "Visit " a(http://www.example.com)"www.example.com" " for more."

=== angle_autolink_mailto
<me@example.com>
--- expect
p a(mailto:me@example.com)"me@example.com"

=== link_in_code_is_text
`https://example.com`
--- expect
p c"https://example.com"

=== entities_numeric_and_named
&lt;div&gt; &#35; &copy; &nbsp;x
--- expect
p "<div> # © \u00a0x"

=== entity_bare_ampersand
R&D and AT&T
--- expect
p "R&D and AT&T"

=== html_inline_is_text
a <span class="x">b</span> c
--- expect
p "a <span class=\"x\">b</span> c"

=== br_variants
a<br/>b<br />c<BR>d
--- expect
p "a" br "b" br "c" br "d"

=== hard_break_two_spaces
@json "first  \nsecond"
--- expect
p "first" br "second"

=== hard_break_backslash
first\
second
--- expect
p "first" br "second"

=== trailing_spaces_one_is_soft
@json "first \nsecond"
--- expect
p "first\nsecond"

=== emphasis_across_soft_break
**one
two**
--- expect
p b"one\ntwo"

=== strike_nested_in_bold
**a ~~b~~ c**
--- expect
p b"a " bs"b" b" c"

=== strike_single_tilde_is_text
~gone~
--- expect
p "~gone~"

=== star_inside_word_with_code
`a*b` and *c*
--- expect
p c"a*b" " and " i"c"

=== vietnamese_text_with_bold
**Đã sửa** lỗi _Hà Nội_ trong `parse.dart`: ký tự "ế" và "ặ".
--- expect
p b"Đã sửa" " lỗi " i"Hà Nội" " trong " c"parse.dart" ": ký tự \"ế\" và \"ặ\"."

=== vietnamese_decomposed
@json "**Hà Nội**"
--- expect
p b"Hà Nội"

=== bidi_override_is_kept_in_text
@json "a \u202eevil\u202c b"
--- expect
p "a \u202eevil\u202c b"

=== emoji_zwj_and_flags
Done 👨‍👩‍👧 🇻🇳 ✅
--- expect
p "Done 👨‍👩‍👧 🇻🇳 ✅"

=== heavy_punctuation
(see **note**), "quoted" and 'single', [brackets] {braces}
--- expect
p "(see " b"note" "), \"quoted\" and 'single', [brackets] {braces}"

=== literal_brackets_no_link
[WARNING] is not a link and [x] neither
--- expect
p "[WARNING] is not a link and [x] neither"

=== emphasis_adjacent_underscores_in_path
Path src/my_dir/a_b.dart and **bold**.
--- expect
p "Path src/my_dir/a_b.dart and " b"bold" "."

=== asterisk_bullet_text_not_list
2 * 3 = 6 and 5*4=20
--- expect
p "2 * 3 = 6 and 5*4=20"
